What is the question actually asking?
Suppose:
s1 = "ab"
s2 = "eidbaooo"

A permutation of "ab" can be:
"ab"
"ba"

We need to check whether any substring of s2 of length 2 contains exactly the same characters as s1

If s1.length = 2, we only need to examine windows of length 2 in s2.
s2 = e i d b a o o o
     ----
     ei

       ----
       id

         ----
         db

           ----
           ba   ← match!
(So window size will be of s1.length(), will store the freq of s1(abb) characaters a-1, b-2 ; and in while sliding the window in s2, if the freq matches:a-1,b-2 ,
 then return true!)
